Disabled 2026-05-18 by Luis + Claude.

Reason: AccActivity ingestRunId schema drift (lib/acc/dcActivityCsvIngest.ts:169 writes
a column that doesn't exist in prisma/schema.prisma AccActivity model).
Every activity insert throws; error is swallowed by dcIngest.ts:992-994; runs report
status=success with zero rows. Compound effect: 2026-05-13 → today activity gap.

Re-enable AFTER:
  1. AccActivity gets `ingestRunId String` column + migration
  2. Slice-loop error handler converts to hard abort (no more silent skip)
  3. Backward-slice admin snapshot is skipped (separate bug — quarantine path)
  4. Progress rows reset (all 428 → NULL/newProjectFlag=true)
  5. Test run inserts >0 rows for `submittals` or `docs`

See: docs/superpowers/specs/2026-05-18-dc-backward-backfill-fix-design.md (pending)
